{{#is_alert}}
## What's happening?
The Collector logged `Exporting failed. Dropping data.` **{{value}} times** during the last 15 minutes. This is unambiguous, permanent loss: retries were exhausted (`max_elapsed_time`, 300s by default) and the batch was discarded after dequeue, so nothing will resend it. There is no counter metric for this, and the log line with its `dropped_items` field is the only record of how much was lost.
{{/is_alert}}
{{#is_recovery}}The Collector stopped logging terminal export failures.{{/is_recovery}}

